{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-11-08 19:37:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON ANNOUNCES PRICING OF PUBLIC OFFERING OF $1.3 BILLION OF DEPOSITARY SHARES REPRESENTING INTERESTS IN PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT PRICED AN UNDERWRITTEN PUBLIC OFFERING OF 1,300,000 DEPOSITARY SHARES, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH\xa0INTEREST IN A SHARE OF ITS SERIES I NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK, WITH A LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE OF\xa0$100,000\xa0PER SHARE (EQUIVALENT TO\xa0$1,000\xa0PER DEPOSITARY SHARE), AT A PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE OF\xa0$1,000\xa0PER DEPOSITARY SHARE ($1.3 BILLION\xa0AGGREGATE PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE).\xa0DIVIDENDS WILL ACCRUE ON THE LIQUIDATION AMOUNT OF\xa0$100,000\xa0PER SHARE OF THE SERIES I PREFERRED STOCK AT A RATE PER ANNUM EQUAL TO 3.750% FROM THE ORIGINAL ISSUE DATE TO, BUT EXCLUDING, DECEMBER 20, 2026 AND FROM, AND INCLUDING, DECEMBER 20, 2026, AT THE "FIVE-YEAR TREASURY RATE" (AS DEFINED IN THE PRELIMINARY PROSPECTUS SUPPLEMENT) AS OF THE MOST RECENT RESET DIVIDEND DETERMINATION DATE PLUS 2.630%.'}{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-11-08 16:15:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON TO SPEAK AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS 2021 US FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EMILY PORTNEY, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, AND ROBIN VINCE, VICE CHAIR OF BNY MELLON AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF GLOBAL MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, WILL SPEAK AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS 2021 US FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE, AT 9:20 A.M. ET ON\xa0WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 8, 2021.'}